 "remarks": "Great location! Available 10/15/26. Welcome home to this bright, versatile and well maintained 3-bed, 2-bath duplex, just steps away from Pemberwick Park in the Glenville School District. The main level features an inviting living room and dining room, eat-in kitchen w/stainless steel appliances, and bonus office or play area. Upstairs you will find 2 comfortable bedrooms w/ample closet space and full bath. Lower level offers 3rd bedroom, 2nd full bath, spacious playroom for flexible living, plus washer/dryer and plenty of storage. Hardwood floors throughout. Enjoy a great backyard with covered porch, perfect for relaxing or entertaining, with convenient on-street parking. This home offers comfort, functionality and a fantastic location-ideal for today's lifestyle. Excellent credit required. No pets. No smoking on premises.",
